{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國人氣男團Seventeen隊長S.COUPS昨晚單拖襲港，吸引大批港迷捱夜接機，他今日上午現身尖沙咀的商場，出席代言行李箱品牌的快閃活動，吸引數百粉絲逼爆商場各層，場面相當墟冚，當中更有不少粉絲通宵排隊霸位。S.COUPS甫現身，全場即發出震耳欲聾的尖叫聲，他親民向四方八面及上層的粉絲揮手。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.629502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:56:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:15.939488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:14.357938+00:00","content_hash":"506abcfc4bcdf11be29766d13ae340a3c8ccef1234561a264c5e8796a54a9471","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.629502+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}